  <name>Polka</name>
  <summary>File manager made for gamepads</summary>
  <summary xml:lang="ru">Файловый менеджер для геймпада</summary>
  <developer id="io.github.sendement">
    <name>Sendem</name>
  </developer>
  <description>
    <p>
      Polka is a classic two-pane file manager that is fully usable with a gamepad
      (DualSense, Xbox, Steam Deck controls) as well as the keyboard and mouse.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Archives open like folders and can be edited; multi-volume archives are grouped</li>
      <li>Built-in viewer and editor for text with syntax highlighting, Markdown, pictures, music and video</li>
      <li>Disk usage as rings, tiles or a list</li>
      <li>Drives: mount, unmount and eject from the sidebar</li>
      <li>A terminal with its own tabs, quick keys for terminal programs, command history and saved commands — all from the pad</li>
      <li>Steam games and Proton prefixes listed by game name</li>
      <li>System files edited, moved or deleted with the sudo password typed on the pad's keyboard</li>
      <li>Packages installed with the system's own tool (pacman, flatpak, apt, dnf…), scripts run, in a terminal window</li>
      <li>Icon themes, accent colors, light and dark looks, nine languages</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">io.github.sendement.Polka.desktop</launchable>
